#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid "Can I drink some of your blood?  I really need some of it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid ""
"It'll have to wait, unfortunately.  If I let you do that too often it'll be "
"very bad for my health."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid "[Drink from them] Thank you.  Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid "[Drink from them] Thank you.  See you later."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid "I changed my mind.  Keep your blood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid ""
"I'm not letting you do that this soon after last time.  I need that blood "
"too, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid ""
"If you really need to, then sure you can.  Don't make an habit out of it, "
"however."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid "Nope.  I'm not going to be your blood bag.  Find someone else for that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid ""
"(As you approach to ask about letting you drink their blood, your senses tell"
" you that whatever blood they have in their veins wouldn't nourish you at "
"all, so you decide to not ask your question)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of effect type id "feed_from_recently"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid "Gave you blood"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Gave you blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_askblood.json
msgid ""
"This person won't accept to let you drink more of their blood for a while."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid "[Use your powers to affect their mind]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid ""
"[You ponder your options and think about the blood you have in you]\n"
"\n"
"You could spend a little blood to slightly influence their opinion of you.\n"
"\n"
"You could spend more blood to make them your friend.\n"
"\n"
"Or you could spend a massive amount of blood to turn them into a renfield, a human obsessed with serving their vampire masters.  In this case the master is you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid "[Spend a little blood to make them like you a bit more]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid "[Spend a moderate amount of blood to make them your friend]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid "[Spend a massive amount of blood to make them your renfield]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid "[Don't spend any blood]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid "[You do not have enough blood in you to manipulate someone's mind]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid ""
"[As your blood is consumed to reshape who they are, you see something die in "
"their eyes, replaced by an obsession to follow your orders]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid "I want to discuss with you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_master_mortal_mind.json
msgid "Just follow me and my orders for now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Maybe there will be non-mentor vampire NPCs someday.  For now, there's
#. only the mentors.
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "vampire"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Vampire Mentor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Job description of "Vampire Mentor" NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"An ancient vampire, willing to assist those who want to further their curse."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Sorry I must go.  Bye!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"Welcome.  What do you seek here?  Fortune?  Safety?  A friend?  A mentor?  "
"What brought you here?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I want to talk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I want a mentor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I want to kill vampires."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I've done it.  I am now a true vampire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Before, you said there was more that I needed to learn?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I've lost the book you gave me.  Do you have another?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I have brought back the components you need for the ritual."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "The mentor vanishes in a fine mist."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Do you want to chat for a bit?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "What do you wish to discuss?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Can I do something for you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "What did you meant by \"mentor\"?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I can help you become a stronger vampire, if it is what you wish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I can share with you the gift of vampirism, if it is what you wish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I want to become a stronger vampire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I want to become a vampire."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "You already made me as strong as a vampire can be.  See you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Maybe later.  Bye."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"There are many vampires in this place.  Feel free to kill the others, I am "
"not affiliated with them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I'm here to kill all vampires, no exceptions.  Prepare to die."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"You seem more reasonable than the rest.  Would you like to be cured of your "
"curse?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "It can wait.  Can we talk?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "It can wait.  Can we discuss what you meant by \"mentor\"?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I am an old vampire, wishing to see more embrace and develop that gift."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"It's a safe place for the blood-drinkers.  Here, it's only them, their "
"servants and their food.  And also those who wish to become blood-drinkers "
"themselves."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"I am overjoyed that a new person decided to take their place as a new ruler "
"of the night!  Soon, you'll be ready for the final step, the one that will "
"allow you to fully walk the path!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Can you help me walk that path?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I just wanted to share the news.  See you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"Yes.  The gifts of the blood are somewhat random, as are its curses.  But now"
" that you have come into your true power, there are ways to expand your "
"talents and to modify your weaknesses.  It will require a great deal of blood"
" and time, but I can show you the way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Yes.  I want more power."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Maybe later, but not now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Concentrate on the blood and watch closely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"You learn how to expand your blood gifts and how to change your vampiric "
"weaknesses."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"I can do it, if you truly want it.  I've seen that those who willingly become"
" vampires are more likely to fully walk the path so I won't attempt to force "
"you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I am sure.  Grant me vampirism."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"[bites you] Here you go.  You might not notice the effects at first, but keep"
" some human blood close for when your thirst will appear and some shelter for"
" when the sun will start to burn your skin.  There are levels of vampiric "
"power that cannot be achieved through time alone.  When you'll reach that "
"point, come back here and I'll help you reach them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Got it.  See you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"You are ready for the next step.  However, I must warn you: there is no "
"coming back from that.  Your vampirism will become impossible to lose.  Do "
"you wish to proceed?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"Your vampirism isn't potent enough.  Come back when your mortal hungers will "
"begin to be replaced by immortal hungers.  They are the signs that your power"
" increased enough to withstand what you'll gain from my help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I am certain.  Make me more powerful."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I do not wish to be struck as a vampire forever."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"I cannot assist you until you bring back the components.  How is the search "
"going?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"You are now ready to fully walk the path.  This time, you'll need to gather a"
" few components before the ritual can be done.  I'll give you this book so "
"you know what to look for."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I'll begin the search then."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "A book?  You said I would only need a few components!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "It's progressing.  See you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "It'll wait for now.  See you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"It's not something I do, it's something you'll do.  I know it'll be asking a "
"lot from you, but I hope you'll understand why we are doing it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Don't tell me.  I'm going."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"To become a true vampire, you must kill someone that cherishes you with your "
"own hands.  It might be hard to bear at first, but with time you'll see how "
"much it was worth it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I'll do it, if it what it takes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"[Uncaring] Make someone love me and then kill them in return for immortality "
"and power?  What's the downside?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "[Pacifist] That's monstrous, of course I won't do that!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I'm not doing that.  Bye."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"They need to be completely trusting of you, someone that consider themselves your \"best friend forever\".  They also need to declare how much they love you right before you kill them, then you'll become a true vampire.  And I almost forgot: you also need to kill them in melee combat or else it won't work.\n"
"\n"
"And when you are done, return to me.  There is more that you must learn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"Do not worry about the pain, my friend.  It is always temporary, no matter how much it hurts.  After that, you won't ever be temporary again.  Keep in mind that they need to be completely trusting of you, someone that consider themselves your \"best friend forever\".  They also need to declare how much they love you right before you kill them, then you'll be freed from your limited time as you become a true vampire.  And I almost forgot: you also need to kill them in melee combat or else it won't work.\n"
"\n"
"And when you are done, return to me.  There is more that you must learn."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"Here's the book.  It contains everything you need to know about the "
"components you need to acquire.  Be sure to read it thoroughly as the rituals"
" have very specific conditions to be accomplished.  Come back here when "
"you'll have them all and you will fully walk the path."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Thank you.  I'll bring back these components."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"This book contains the rituals allowing to obtain the components.  Each of "
"them requires a complicated process to get.  I'm giving you this book so you "
"won't come back asking for more information every two hours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"I do have another copy, however you'll have to buy it at a steep price.  Each"
" of these are written by hand these days so we can't let people treat them "
"like disposable things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "[$100] I'll buy the book."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I'll come back later for that.  See you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"I'm not the only vampire looking to assist others on the path.  We wrote this"
" book together and occasionally meet to update and refine it, all in the goal"
" of helping new vampires reach their true potential as easily as possible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Where are these other mentors?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "See you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"I do not know of their whereabouts.  All what matters is that we know where "
"to meet, but with the end of the world all meetings has been postponed "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"[Your mentor takes the components and engages in a complex ritual, before "
"passing you a bowl filled with a red liquid].  Drink it, and you'll have "
"completed the process of walking the path."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "[Drink it]"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"You have now reached the apex of the vampiric condition and do not need "
"further guidance.  Go forth and claim your title and crown of ruler of the "
"night!  Make it clear that you are the one on the throne!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Got it.  Farewell, my friend."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"No.  I've long passed the point of no return.  Either your cure won't do "
"anything, or it'll kill me."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Then you must die."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I understand.  Can we talk?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "No thanks.  I am here to help others, not because I need help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Then I'd like your help as a mentor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Then I'd like your help as a vampire slayer."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"No thanks.  I've decided long ago to never gamble my life for someone else's "
"cause.  I prefer waiting on the side, helping those who want my help."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I want your help, mentor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "I do not care for such frivolous things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Kill your best friend"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Kill someone that is very close to you to push your vampirism further."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"If you wish to become a true vampire, you must sacrifice someone that really,"
" really likes you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"It brings me joy to see someone willing to fully walk the path.  Remember, "
"pain is always temporary, no matter how it hurts.  By this sacrifice, you "
"won't ever be temporary again."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"I understand.  Some never wanted to walk the path.  Such wasted potential."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"They need to be completely trusting of you, someone that thinks of themselves"
" as your \"best friend forever\".  In addition, keep in mind that the "
"sacrifice must be killed by none and nothing other than you, or else you'll "
"have to find a new sacrifice."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Have you found someone that considers you the best person in the world?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"You visibly succeeded.  You should gain more vampiric aptitudes soon.  "
"However, you haven't fully walked the path yet.  Give your powers some time "
"to grow, come here again and I'll explain what to do to completely walk the "
"path!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid ""
"Either your vampirism isn't advanced enough, or you tried to bypass the "
"sacrifice.  Either way, do that sacrifice."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Kill your best friend"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Someday you'll find a suitable sacrifice."
msgstr ""
